<title>USA: Dillard board oks class A common buyback.</title>
<headline>Dillard board oks class A common buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillard Department Stores Inc said Tuesday that its board has approved a Class A common share repurchase program of up to $300 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would make the purchases from time to time on the open market.</p>
</text>
